        "verdict": "SUPPORTED",
        "note": "Wikipedia describes a miniature mountain landscape 17 m underground with tiny pools of liquid mercury representing lakes, in a tunnel researchers believe was sealed around 200 CE; Archaeology Magazine reported the mercury find in April 2015 and describes the tunnel as sealed roughly 1,800 years earlier.",
