        "verdict": "SUPPORTED",
        "note": "Wikipedia names Gomez Chavez and Gazzola, the late-2003 date, the rain-opened sinkhole, the nearly 5 m shaft and the corridor of nearly 100 m; the ASU and Archaeology reports agree the tunnel was found in 2003 after a sinkhole opened in front of the temple.",
        "correction": null,
