        "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Teotihuacan"
      },
      {
        "claim": "The identity of Teotihuacan's founders, their language and the city's original name are unknown, and the Nahuatl name Teotihuacan was given by the Aztecs centuries after the city fell.",
